GAME-TEMPLATE for utilizing my own "game engine" as a shared library

Engine: C++ ECS, Model loader and Path Tracer using lwcgl v2.9.3. https://github.com/xt9y/Horse.git

Prerequisites: https://github.com/xt9y-org/lwcgl/tree/v2.9.3
AND if you are on mac also: https://github.com/xt9y-org/lwmgl

build --> c build run
